  "bio": "Jay Cain is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in realism, geometric, and floral styles, based in Reading, PA. Operating out of Inked Studios, Jay's professionalism is evident in the meticulous attention to detail and precision in each design. Clients can expect a dedicated craftsman who ensures that the vision for their ink is fully realized with finesse and expertise.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Reading, Pennsylvania, United States"
